{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/Main_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your fleet of ships and fight against each other to conquer the Battlegeuse solar system. There are 5 fleets for each player to play with, each of these has different properties, speed, energy consumption, etc.. The goal is to destroy the opponent's mothership on each planet of the solar system, conquered all the planets, the player wins the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/buy_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn money to buy a better spaceship. In Battlegeuse you have many different strategies to get the better of your enemy, having the fastest and most agile ship is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/defenses_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build special buildings to defend your conquered planet. There are 7 different modules, each with unique potential. It is up to you and your strategy to buy the right module.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/DESTROY_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the map with missiles to open up different paths and create your own winning strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/SUPERWAPON_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/RES_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect valuable resources for your battle. collect emeralds to add research points, you will need them to buy additional modules and weapons.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1745576892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653240?t=1745576892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/2439c3793427eb21896dc794730e5d016ce811e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745576892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/2439c3793427eb21896dc794730e5d016ce811e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745576892","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/Main_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your fleet of ships and fight against each other to conquer the Battlegeuse solar system. There are 5 fleets for each player to play with, each of these has different properties, speed, energy consumption, etc.. The goal is to destroy the opponent's mothership on each planet of the solar system, conquered all the planets, the player wins the tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653240/extras/buy_Descr_im.png?t=1745576892\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragra